{
 "fps": 24,
 "frame_end": 14721,
 "seconds": 613.375,
 "shots": [
  {
   "id": "0.1",
   "start": 1,
   "frames": 72,
   "seconds": 3.0,
   "lines": []
  },
  {
   "id": "0.2",
   "start": 73,
   "frames": 168,
   "seconds": 7.0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "0.2",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "True!\u2014nervous\u2014very, very dreadfully nervous I had been and am;",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/0.2_0_N_41d02577a7.wav",
     "seconds": 5.073,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "0.3",
   "start": 241,
   "frames": 243,
   "seconds": 10.125,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "0.3",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "but why will you say that I am mad? The disease had sharpened my senses\u2014not destroyed\u2014not dulled them. Above all was the sense of hearing acute.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/0.3_0_N_b265b3ed0f.wav",
     "seconds": 9.114,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "0.4",
   "start": 484,
   "frames": 168,
   "seconds": 7.0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "0.4",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "I heard all things in the heaven and in the earth. I heard many things in hell.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/0.4_0_N_d083b3242c.wav",
     "seconds": 4.655,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "0.5",
   "start": 652,
   "frames": 207,
   "seconds": 8.625,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "0.5",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "How, then, am I mad? Hearken! and observe how healthily\u2014how calmly I can tell you the whole story.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/0.5_0_N_128c0297f4.wav",
     "seconds": 7.628,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "T",
   "start": 859,
   "frames": 120,
   "seconds": 5.0,
   "lines": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1.1",
   "start": 979,
   "frames": 120,
   "seconds": 5.0,
   "lines": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1.2",
   "start": 1099,
   "frames": 211,
   "seconds": 8.791666666666666,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "1.2",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "It is impossible to say how first the idea entered my brain; but once conceived, it haunted me day and night.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/1.2_0_N_e006e1cadb.wav",
     "seconds": 7.778,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "1.3",
   "start": 1310,
   "frames": 120,
   "seconds": 5.0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "1.3",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "Object there was none. Passion there was none.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/1.3_0_N_9af1470ed2.wav",
     "seconds": 3.982,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "1.4",
   "start": 1430,
   "frames": 168,
   "seconds": 7.0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "1.4",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "I loved the old man. He had never wronged me. He had never given me insult.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/1.4_0_N_29bc29d5ab.wav",
     "seconds": 5.48,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "1.5",
   "start": 1598,
   "frames": 96,
   "seconds": 4.0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "1.5",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "For his gold I had no desire.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/1.5_0_N_4f5524dc12.wav",
     "seconds": 2.113,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "1.6",
   "start": 1694,
   "frames": 120,
   "seconds": 5.0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "1.6",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "I think it was his eye! yes, it was this!",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/1.6_0_N_208c6689c6.wav",
     "seconds": 3.332,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "1.7",
   "start": 1814,
   "frames": 168,
   "seconds": 7.0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "1.7",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "One of his eyes resembled that of a vulture\u2014a pale blue eye, with a film over it.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/1.7_0_N_399b2d44a0.wav",
     "seconds": 5.84,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "1.8",
   "start": 1982,
   "frames": 107,
   "seconds": 4.458333333333333,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "1.8",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "Whenever it fell upon me, my blood ran cold;",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/1.8_0_N_cf1c942d77.wav",
     "seconds": 3.471,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "1.9",
   "start": 2089,
   "frames": 251,
   "seconds": 10.458333333333334,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "1.9",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "and so by degrees\u2014very gradually\u2014I made up my mind to take the life of the old man, and thus rid myself of the eye for ever.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/1.9_0_N_301e4442c4.wav",
     "seconds": 9.462,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "2.1",
   "start": 2340,
   "frames": 280,
   "seconds": 11.666666666666666,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "2.1",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "Now this is the point. You fancy me mad. Madmen know nothing. But you should have seen me. You should have seen how wisely I proceeded\u2014with what caution\u2014with what foresight!",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/2.1_0_N_39ea785f2d.wav",
     "seconds": 10.646,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "2.2",
   "start": 2620,
   "frames": 128,
   "seconds": 5.333333333333333,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "2.2",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "I was never kinder to the old man than during the whole week before I killed him.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/2.2_0_N_3205d8893d.wav",
     "seconds": 4.354,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "2.3",
   "start": 2748,
   "frames": 173,
   "seconds": 7.208333333333333,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "2.3",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "And every night, about midnight, I turned the latch of his door and opened it\u2014oh, so gently!",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/2.3_0_N_a194a4845b.wav",
     "seconds": 6.211,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "2.4",
   "start": 2921,
   "frames": 246,
   "seconds": 10.25,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "2.4",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "And then, when I had made an opening sufficient for my head, I put in a dark lantern, all closed, closed, so that no light shone out, and then I thrust in my head.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/2.4_0_N_5f1c45edfd.wav",
     "seconds": 9.253,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "2.5",
   "start": 3167,
   "frames": 312,
   "seconds": 13.0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "2.5",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "It took me an hour to place my whole head within the opening so far that I could see him as he lay upon his bed. Ha!\u2014would a madman have been so wise as this?",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/2.5_0_N_a9c2b8ad20.wav",
     "seconds": 10.53,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "2.6",
   "start": 3479,
   "frames": 250,
   "seconds": 10.416666666666666,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "2.6",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "And then, when my head was well in the room, I undid the lantern cautiously\u2014oh, so cautiously\u2014cautiously (for the hinges creaked)\u2014",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/2.6_0_N_133a48c113.wav",
     "seconds": 9.404,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "2.7",
   "start": 3729,
   "frames": 144,
   "seconds": 6.0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "2.7",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "I undid it just so much that a single thin ray fell upon the vulture eye.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/2.7_0_N_ab8754db24.wav",
     "seconds": 4.226,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "2.8",
   "start": 3873,
   "frames": 384,
   "seconds": 16.0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "2.8",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "And this I did for seven long nights\u2014every night just at midnight\u2014but I found the eye always closed; and so it was impossible to do the work; for it was not the old man who vexed me, but his Evil Eye.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/2.8_0_N_84df4d628f.wav",
     "seconds": 12.701,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "2.9",
   "start": 4257,
   "frames": 551,
   "seconds": 22.958333333333332,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "2.9",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "And every morning, when the day broke, I went boldly into the chamber,",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/2.9_0_N_368568ab4a.wav",
     "seconds": 5.004,
     "offset": 0.4
    },
    {
     "shot": "2.9",
     "index": 1,
     "who": "NS",
     "adapted": true,
     "text": "Good morning, sir! Did you pass the night well?",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/2.9_1_NS_c6f8016529.wav",
     "seconds": 3.498,
     "offset": 5.754
    },
    {
     "shot": "2.9",
     "index": 2,
     "who": "OM",
     "adapted": true,
     "text": "Well enough, my boy. Well enough.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/2.9_2_OM_29a3912ad2.wav",
     "seconds": 3.748,
     "offset": 9.602
    },
    {
     "shot": "2.9",
     "index": 3,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "He would have been a very profound old man, indeed, to suspect that every night, just at twelve, I looked in upon him while he slept.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/2.9_3_N_8e10a844bf.wav",
     "seconds": 8.661,
     "offset": 13.7
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "3.1",
   "start": 4808,
   "frames": 201,
   "seconds": 8.375,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "3.1",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "Upon the eighth night I was more than usually cautious in opening the door. A watch's minute hand moves more quickly than did mine.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/3.1_0_N_fbe6974344.wav",
     "seconds": 7.372,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "3.2",
   "start": 5009,
   "frames": 144,
   "seconds": 6.0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "3.2",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "Never before that night had I felt the extent of my own powers.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/3.2_0_N_de99e178e7.wav",
     "seconds": 3.796,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "3.3",
   "start": 5153,
   "frames": 100,
   "seconds": 4.166666666666667,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "3.3",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "I fairly chuckled at the idea; and perhaps he heard me;",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/3.3_0_N_d64111ae4f.wav",
     "seconds": 3.146,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "3.4",
   "start": 5253,
   "frames": 111,
   "seconds": 4.625,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "3.4",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "for he moved on the bed suddenly, as if startled.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/3.4_0_N_fcb24d9701.wav",
     "seconds": 3.622,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "3.5",
   "start": 5364,
   "frames": 352,
   "seconds": 14.666666666666666,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "3.5",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "Now you may think that I drew back\u2014but no. His room was as black as pitch with the thick darkness, and so I knew that he could not see the opening of the door, and I kept pushing it on steadily, steadily.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/3.5_0_N_666b3ccf80.wav",
     "seconds": 13.653,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "3.6",
   "start": 5716,
   "frames": 169,
   "seconds": 7.041666666666667,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "3.6",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "I had my head in, and was about to open the lantern, when my thumb slipped upon the tin fastening,",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/3.6_0_N_4806f6f8bf.wav",
     "seconds": 6.037,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "3.7",
   "start": 5885,
   "frames": 139,
   "seconds": 5.791666666666667,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "3.7",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "and the old man sprang up in the bed, crying out\u2014",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/3.7_0_N_8b4d21bf59.wav",
     "seconds": 3.088,
     "offset": 0.4
    },
    {
     "shot": "3.7",
     "index": 1,
     "who": "OM",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "Who's there?",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/3.7_1_OM_2008b89f31.wav",
     "seconds": 1.344,
     "offset": 3.838
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "3.8",
   "start": 6024,
   "frames": 384,
   "seconds": 16.0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "3.8",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "I kept quite still and said nothing. For a whole hour I did not move a muscle. He was still sitting up in the bed, listening;\u2014just as I have done, night after night, hearkening to the death watches in the wall.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/3.8_0_N_f908a5eab4.wav",
     "seconds": 12.411,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "3.9",
   "start": 6408,
   "frames": 72,
   "seconds": 3.0,
   "lines": []
  },
  {
   "id": "3.10",
   "start": 6480,
   "frames": 144,
   "seconds": 6.0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "3.10",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "Presently I heard a slight groan, and I knew it was the groan of mortal terror.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/3.10_0_N_c40c16b603.wav",
     "seconds": 4.737,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "3.11",
   "start": 6624,
   "frames": 290,
   "seconds": 12.083333333333334,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "3.11",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "He had been saying to himself\u2014",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/3.11_0_N_f5bcdd24ab.wav",
     "seconds": 2.519,
     "offset": 0.4
    },
    {
     "shot": "3.11",
     "index": 1,
     "who": "OM",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "It is nothing but the wind in the chimney\u2014it is only a mouse crossing the floor\u2014it is merely a cricket which has made a single chirp.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/3.11_1_OM_13951a7ca0.wav",
     "seconds": 8.195,
     "offset": 3.269
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "3.12",
   "start": 6914,
   "frames": 184,
   "seconds": 7.666666666666667,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "3.12",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "All in vain; because Death, in approaching him, had stalked with his black shadow before him, and enveloped the victim.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/3.12_0_N_b222e815b5.wav",
     "seconds": 6.652,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "3.13",
   "start": 7098,
   "frames": 301,
   "seconds": 12.541666666666666,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "3.13",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "So I opened it\u2014you cannot imagine how stealthily, stealthily\u2014until, at length, a single dim ray, like the thread of the spider, shot from out the crevice and fell upon the vulture eye.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/3.13_0_N_60b2a1f8df.wav",
     "seconds": 11.528,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "3.14",
   "start": 7399,
   "frames": 148,
   "seconds": 6.166666666666667,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "3.14",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "It was open\u2014wide, wide open\u2014and I grew furious as I gazed upon it.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/3.14_0_N_5bd313e765.wav",
     "seconds": 5.155,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "3.15",
   "start": 7547,
   "frames": 412,
   "seconds": 17.166666666666668,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "3.15",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "And now\u2014have I not told you that what you mistake for madness is but over-acuteness of the senses?\u2014there came to my ears a low, dull, quick sound, such as a watch makes when enveloped in cotton. It was the beating of the old man's heart.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/3.15_0_N_29a58eaae8.wav",
     "seconds": 16.184,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "3.16",
   "start": 7959,
   "frames": 288,
   "seconds": 12.0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "3.16",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "It grew quicker and quicker, and louder and louder every instant. And now a new anxiety seized me\u2014the sound would be heard by a neighbor! The old man's hour had come!",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/3.16_0_N_14049d797b.wav",
     "seconds": 10.658,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "3.17",
   "start": 8247,
   "frames": 72,
   "seconds": 3.0,
   "lines": []
  },
  {
   "id": "3.18",
   "start": 8319,
   "frames": 264,
   "seconds": 11.0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "3.18",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "In an instant I dragged him to the floor, and pulled the heavy bed over him. But, for many minutes, the heart beat on with a muffled sound.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/3.18_0_N_2dd56d4ff9.wav",
     "seconds": 8.893,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "3.19",
   "start": 8583,
   "frames": 72,
   "seconds": 3.0,
   "lines": []
  },
  {
   "id": "3.20",
   "start": 8655,
   "frames": 168,
   "seconds": 7.0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "3.20",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "At length it ceased. The old man was dead.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/3.20_0_N_0b8efe4bf2.wav",
     "seconds": 3.413,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "3.21",
   "start": 8823,
   "frames": 216,
   "seconds": 9.0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "3.21",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "There was no pulsation. He was stone dead. His eye would trouble me no more.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/3.21_0_N_6db4e0d377.wav",
     "seconds": 4.864,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "4.1",
   "start": 9039,
   "frames": 209,
   "seconds": 8.708333333333334,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "4.1",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "If still you think me mad, you will think so no longer when I describe the wise precautions I took for the concealment of the body.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/4.1_0_N_6d11d9428f.wav",
     "seconds": 7.72,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "4.2",
   "start": 9248,
   "frames": 144,
   "seconds": 6.0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "4.2",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "The night waned, and I worked hastily, but in silence.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/4.2_0_N_5b88940adb.wav",
     "seconds": 3.866,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "4.3",
   "start": 9392,
   "frames": 192,
   "seconds": 8.0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "4.3",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "I then took up three planks from the flooring of the chamber, and deposited all between the scantlings.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/4.3_0_N_0532c2e697.wav",
     "seconds": 5.851,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "4.4",
   "start": 9584,
   "frames": 196,
   "seconds": 8.166666666666666,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "4.4",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "I then replaced the boards so cleverly, so cunningly, that no human eye\u2014not even his\u2014could have detected any thing wrong.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/4.4_0_N_15e62d5d5b.wav",
     "seconds": 7.152,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "4.5",
   "start": 9780,
   "frames": 216,
   "seconds": 9.0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "4.5",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "There was nothing to wash out\u2014no blood-spot whatever. A tub had caught all\u2014ha! ha!",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/4.5_0_N_4a4bc9046d.wav",
     "seconds": 7.233,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "4.6",
   "start": 9996,
   "frames": 192,
   "seconds": 8.0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "4.6",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "When I had made an end of these labors, it was four o'clock\u2014still dark as midnight.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/4.6_0_N_225d7166ba.wav",
     "seconds": 5.735,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "5.1",
   "start": 10188,
   "frames": 206,
   "seconds": 8.583333333333334,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "5.1",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "As the bell sounded the hour, there came a knocking at the street door. I went down to open it with a light heart\u2014for what had I now to fear?",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/5.1_0_N_3bcf369921.wav",
     "seconds": 7.581,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "5.2",
   "start": 10394,
   "frames": 317,
   "seconds": 13.208333333333334,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "5.2",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "There entered three men, who introduced themselves, with perfect suavity, as officers of the police.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/5.2_0_N_e6dfd3c719.wav",
     "seconds": 6.919,
     "offset": 0.4
    },
    {
     "shot": "5.2",
     "index": 1,
     "who": "O1",
     "adapted": true,
     "text": "Forgive the hour, sir. A neighbour heard a shriek in the night. We are bound to search the premises.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/5.2_1_O1_ad2ac35ae5.wav",
     "seconds": 4.949,
     "offset": 7.669
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "5.3",
   "start": 10711,
   "frames": 211,
   "seconds": 8.791666666666666,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "5.3",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "NS",
     "adapted": true,
     "text": "A shriek? My own, gentlemen\u2014in a dream. The old man is away in the country. Come in, come in!",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/5.3_0_NS_ee50cb2cf4.wav",
     "seconds": 7.805,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "5.4",
   "start": 10922,
   "frames": 192,
   "seconds": 8.0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "5.4",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "I took my visitors all over the house. I bade them search\u2014search well.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/5.4_0_N_77d00bfc9f.wav",
     "seconds": 4.319,
     "offset": 0.4
    },
    {
     "shot": "5.4",
     "index": 1,
     "who": "NS",
     "adapted": true,
     "text": "Search well, gentlemen!",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/5.4_1_NS_bfb75220ce.wav",
     "seconds": 1.953,
     "offset": 5.069
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "5.5",
   "start": 11114,
   "frames": 198,
   "seconds": 8.25,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "5.5",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "I led them, at length, to his chamber. I showed them his treasures, secure, undisturbed.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/5.5_0_N_fe43dd0bd7.wav",
     "seconds": 7.244,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "5.6",
   "start": 11312,
   "frames": 390,
   "seconds": 16.25,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "5.6",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "I brought chairs into the room, and desired them here to rest from their fatigues, while I myself, in the wild audacity of my perfect triumph, placed my own seat upon the very spot beneath which reposed the corpse of the victim.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/5.6_0_N_2eafe247a0.wav",
     "seconds": 15.244,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "5.7",
   "start": 11702,
   "frames": 391,
   "seconds": 16.291666666666668,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "5.7",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "The officers were satisfied. My manner had convinced them. I was singularly at ease.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/5.7_0_N_b776b12cf3.wav",
     "seconds": 5.433,
     "offset": 0.4
    },
    {
     "shot": "5.7",
     "index": 1,
     "who": "O2",
     "adapted": true,
     "text": "Cold night for it, eh?",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/5.7_1_O2_ade131d1fb.wav",
     "seconds": 1.965,
     "offset": 6.183
    },
    {
     "shot": "5.7",
     "index": 2,
     "who": "O3",
     "adapted": true,
     "text": "Colder than a churchyard.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/5.7_2_O3_6c5590607f.wav",
     "seconds": 1.512,
     "offset": 8.498
    },
    {
     "shot": "5.7",
     "index": 3,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "They sat, and while I answered cheerily, they chatted of familiar things.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/5.7_3_N_c398c6ddfe.wav",
     "seconds": 5.329,
     "offset": 10.36
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "5.8",
   "start": 12093,
   "frames": 240,
   "seconds": 10.0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "5.8",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "But, ere long, I felt myself getting pale and wished them gone. My head ached, and I fancied a ringing in my ears.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/5.8_0_N_de2202bc28.wav",
     "seconds": 8.916,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "5.9",
   "start": 12333,
   "frames": 168,
   "seconds": 7.0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "5.9",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "The ringing became more distinct\u2014until, at length, I found that the noise was not within my ears.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/5.9_0_N_d82efae75f.wav",
     "seconds": 6.014,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "5.10",
   "start": 12501,
   "frames": 312,
   "seconds": 13.0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "5.10",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "It was a low, dull, quick sound\u2014much such a sound as a watch makes when enveloped in cotton. I gasped for breath\u2014and yet the officers heard it not.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/5.10_0_N_7ec6faddb3.wav",
     "seconds": 10.275,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "5.11",
   "start": 12813,
   "frames": 355,
   "seconds": 14.791666666666666,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "5.11",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "I arose and argued about trifles, in a high key and with violent gesticulations; but the noise steadily increased. I paced the floor to and fro with heavy strides\u2014but the noise steadily increased.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/5.11_0_N_248513c77d.wav",
     "seconds": 13.792,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "5.12",
   "start": 13168,
   "frames": 324,
   "seconds": 13.5,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "5.12",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "Oh God! what could I do? I foamed\u2014I raved\u2014I swore! I swung the chair upon which I had been sitting, and grated it upon the boards, but the noise arose over all.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/5.12_0_N_8f684809b5.wav",
     "seconds": 12.492,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "5.13",
   "start": 13492,
   "frames": 407,
   "seconds": 16.958333333333332,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "5.13",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "It grew louder\u2014louder\u2014louder! And still the men chatted pleasantly, and smiled. Was it possible they heard not? Almighty God!\u2014no, no! They heard!\u2014they suspected!\u2014they knew!\u2014they were making a mockery of my horror!",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/5.13_0_N_fc0ddc0354.wav",
     "seconds": 15.952,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "5.14",
   "start": 13899,
   "frames": 195,
   "seconds": 8.125,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "5.14",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "I felt that I must scream or die!\u2014and now\u2014again!\u2014hark! louder! louder! louder! louder!\u2014",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/5.14_0_N_fd9da840a3.wav",
     "seconds": 7.128,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "5.15",
   "start": 14094,
   "frames": 220,
   "seconds": 9.166666666666666,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "5.15",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "NS",
     "adapted": false,
     "text": "Villains! Dissemble no more! I admit the deed!\u2014tear up the planks!\u2014here, here!\u2014it is the beating of his hideous heart!",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/5.15_0_NS_828a1f297f.wav",
     "seconds": 8.165,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "6.1",
   "start": 14314,
   "frames": 72,
   "seconds": 3.0,
   "lines": []
  },
  {
   "id": "6.2",
   "start": 14386,
   "frames": 120,
   "seconds": 5.0,
   "lines": [
    {
     "shot": "6.2",
     "index": 0,
     "who": "N",
     "adapted": true,
     "text": "Hearken.",
     "file": "audio/voiceovers/the_tell_tale_heart/6.2_0_N_6770e82329.wav",
     "seconds": 0.662,
     "offset": 0.4
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "6.3",
   "start": 14506,
   "frames": 216,
   "seconds": 9.0,
   "lines": []
  }
 ]
}